OL,4,CDrivers over 70 face eye tests every   
OL,5,Cthree years under new plans            
OL,6,GOver-70s will have to take eye tests   
OL,7,Gevery three years or face losing their 
OL,8,Gdriving licence under new road safety  
OL,9,Gplans.                                 
OL,11,FMandatory eyesight tests are part of   
OL,12,Fthe Department for Transport's (DfT)   
OL,13,Froad safety strategy, expected within  
OL,14,Fweeks.                                 
OL,16,FAround 6.5 million over-70s hold       
OL,17,Fdrivers' licences, with 1.6 million of 
OL,18,Fthose aged 80 or over.                 
